      "_id": "7ba8c974ba9f4297",
      "name": "Auspex — 1 Basic — Soulsight",
      "type": "power",
      "img": "icons/magic/unholy/silhouette-evil-horned-summon.webp",
      "system": {
        "description": "<p>Look at your target and perform a Static Mental Challenge (difficulty equal to the target's Mental Traits). If you succeed, ask one question: what manner of creature the target is, whether affected by magic, whether they committed diablerie recently, their current emotional state, or whether their last utterance was a lie; the target must answer truthfully. Expending a Mental Trait and winning or tying a Mental Challenge lets you see nearby ghosts as pale, indistinct auras.</p>",
